verses.text:
Comp. Jer. xxxi. 27 (in LXX. it is xxxviii. 27);
Hos. ii. 23; Zech. x. 9; Matt.
xiii. 31–43.

Deut. vi. 4, 5; Lev. xix. 18; comp. Matt. xxii. 34–40; Mark xii.
28–34; Luke x. 25–28; and for the rest, Ex. xx. 12–17; Deut. v. 16–21;
Rom. xiii. 9.

Again an error;
for these words precede the others. These are found in
Isa. i. 2.

Or rather, our Lord
Himself. See Matt. xi. 13;
Luke xvi. 16.
